                <pb facs="0256" n="168" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg168"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Miss Anna B. Etzel to the President</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Denver, Colo.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-13"><hi rendition="#italic">June 13,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Will you please cause strict inquiry to be made into circumstances surrounding
                    the death of my brother, Lewis L. Etzel, war correspondent, who was killed by
                    Chinese soldiers at Niuchwang June 6.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Anna B. Etzel.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
